<section class="editorial-intro" id="about"><div class="editorial-intro__heading"><p class="editorial-label">Why Pegasus</p><h2>A setup that stays understandable.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>Linux is powerful because it can be shaped around the way you work. Pegasus collects the configuration knowledge, themes, and practical steps needed to make that shaping less fragile.</p><p>It is a starting point for building a Linux environment with intention.</p></div></section>
